"settings.mic" = "Virtual microphone";
"settings.mic.help" = "Install RmoteVibe Mic, then select that device once inside 豆包. Leave this Mac’s own microphone as the system default input. While Siri is held, the virtual mic leaves the Mac microphone. IOBluetooth and IOHID watch the paired remote and record what arrives. While the Bluetooth HCI trace is readable, that hold plays the remote's Opus through the virtual mic. On release it plays the Mac microphone. The device advertises a USB transport because 豆包 has skipped some virtual devices. Whether this 豆包 lists it is unverified. coreaudiod may ignore an ad-hoc signature. If the device never appears, sign both targets with your Personal Team and install again.";
