"settings.allow" = "Allow pointer and other buttons while speaking";
"settings.allow.help" = "Off by default. While Siri is held, the pointer, taps, scrolling, dragging, and other buttons stop. Turn this on to use them together. System volume and playback are suppressed so one press does not fire twice. That suppression is dropped by sleep and comes back only after this app applies it again.";

