"settings.touch" = "Touch";
"settings.touch.help" = "Move the pointer with one finger. A short tap clicks. A swipe that starts in the outer 12% scrolls and does not move the pointer. Drag is click-ring center held plus travel past a small slop, so a tap does not become a drag. The center is the mouse button and is not in the list below. Extra fingers are ignored.";
"settings.buttons" = "Buttons";
"settings.buttons.help" = "Siri stays on voice. Click-ring center stays the mouse button. Each button below runs the action you pick. Click-ring directions are not mapped in this version. Defaults: Back is Escape, Play/Pause and the volume keys post that same media key after the system one is suppressed, Home is Return.";
"settings.suppress.help" = "Volume, mute, and play/pause are remapped to a null key for vendor 0x004C product 0x0315, so macOS does not also change volume or start playback. The remap does not survive sleep, reboot, or unplugging the remote. This app puts it back after wake, when the remote connects, and every few seconds while running. Quitting removes it. If this app is not running after sleep, the system actions return.";

